. * ==============================================================================
. 
. graph combine ${c -(}figure_output{c )-}dynamic_mo_1.gph ${c -(}figure_output{c )-}dynamic_mo_2.gph ///
> ${c -(}figure_output{c )-}dynamic_mo_3.gph ${c -(}figure_output{c )-}dynamic_mo_4.gph
